# The Q25's own keyboard map, kept whatever the input method.
# Since Android 14, Android lays a layout of its own over a physical keyboard, chosen after the
# input method's subtype (French gives AZERTY, English drops the Alt layer of Q25_keyboard.kcm).
# A layout made for the device's vendor and product ids comes first, before the subtype's: this
# one, which changes no key, so that Q25_keyboard.kcm stays as it is, Alt layer included.
type OVERLAY
